      "path": "/books/al-kafi:5:2:18:4",
      "text": [
        " مُشْتَرِي الْعُقْدَةِ مَرْزُوقٌ وَ بَائِعُهَا مَمْحُوقٌ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Muhammad, from Salih Bin Abu Hammad, from Al Hassan Bin Ali, from Wahab Al Hareyri, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The buyer of the real estate receives sustenance, and the seller of it is annihilated’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. Ali ibn Muhammad ibn Ali has narrated from Salih ibn abu Hammad from al-Hassan ibn Ali from Wahab al-Haririy who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘The buyer of real property receives sustenance and the seller thereof suffers a serious loss.” "
        ]
      }
